Package: zed
Architecture: amd64
Description: Code editor built for humans.
 Zed is a high-performance, collaborative code editor built for serious
 workflows. It's designed to be fast, beautiful, and productive, with
 features like built-in AI assistance, Git integration, and support
 for over 50 programming languages.